  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/ib-acio-grade-ii-executive-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MHA Intelligence Bureau IB</a>&nbsp;</span>has released the Tier-II Final Result for the post of Assistant Central Intelligence Officer (ACIO) Grade-II / Executive Posts on the official website of IB. This recruitment was released for 3717 posts. Applications for the IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 19 July 2025, to 10 August 2025. The tier II examination going to conducted on 11 January 2026. Candidates who had appeared for this examination can download their IB ACIO Gr-II Executive Tier-II Final Result 2026 from the link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Intelligence Bureau (IB), Ministry of Home Affairs (MHA)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IB ACIO Grade-II Executive Tier-II Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Offline Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>12 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>16, 17 &amp; 18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>05 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>13 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>22 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>21 November 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam City Details : <strong>31 December 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date : 11 January 2026</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Result : <strong>05 March 2026</strong> <strong>Available</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result : <strong>03 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 650/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: Rs. 550/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Female <strong>: Rs. 550/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI 